stateDiagram-v2
    %% CURRENT implementation; sources and guards in transition inventory.
    %% Binding transition policy: TelephoneContactBinding; no shared Email policy.
    state "UNVERIFIED id=1" as UNVERIFIED
    state "VERIFIED id=2" as VERIFIED
    state "SUSPENDED id=3" as SUSPENDED
    state "DELETED id=4" as DELETED
    state "NOTHING id=5" as NOTHING
    state "UNVERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP id=6" as UNVERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP
    state "VERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP id=7" as VERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP
    [*] --> UNVERIFIED
    [*] --> UNVERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP
    UNVERIFIED --> VERIFIED: Base ceremony final commit
    UNVERIFIED --> VERIFIED: finalize_registration_binding! with original bounded verified proof
    VERIFIED --> DELETED: owner-locked Base release and Source audit intent
    VERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP --> DELETED: owner-locked Base release and Source audit intent
    SUSPENDED --> DELETED: owner-locked Base release and Source audit intent
    UNVERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP --> VERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP: owner-locked signup finalization and Source intent
UNVERIFIED --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    VERIFIED --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    SUSPENDED --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    DELETED --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    NOTHING --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    UNVERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    VERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    UNVERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP --> DELETED: SignUpArtifactCleanup dependent retention
    note right of DELETED
        Base removal requires the owning authenticated Actor context.
        Binding release and Source audit intent commit together.
        Exact terminal retry creates no further intent.
        Settings replacement retains old status and releases its binding fact
        atomically with the new candidate and both Source intents.
        Database binding checks reject null, empty and whitespace-only digests.
        Forward recognition requires Source intent or completed signup proof.
        Unknown history or effective conflicts abort with row IDs.
        Existing facts, status and OTP counters remain unchanged.
    end note
    note right of VERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP
        Signup carries explicit Actor context and immutable flow operation reference.
        Anonymous requests have no authenticated actor attribution.
        Contact finalization and audit intent share the Source transaction.
    end note
